    "updated_at": "2022-06-14T00:37:20Z",
    "body": "| spec | values | initial |\r\n|------|--------|------|\r\n| compat | border-box, padding-box, content-box, text | none |\r\n| css background | border-box, padding-box, content-box | border-box |\r\n| css 4 background | `<box>`, border, text | border-box |\r\n\r\n[`<box>`](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-backgrounds-3/#typedef-box) here means `border-box`, `padding-box`,  `content-box`\r\n\r\n![Screen Shot 2022-06-14 at 9 32 09](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/505230/173469375-c3f4191e-3cbd-4ef2-a78a-118f02156d9d.png)\r\n",
