    "updated_at": "2022-06-14T10:03:04Z",
    "body": "@karlcow just so I understand, all the engines support unprefixed `background-clip`, so you propose to remove the prefixed one from the compat standard? If more than one UA still supports a prefixed alias, I would prefer to keep it in the spec. Once everyone is committed to unship the webkit-prefixed one, it seems good to remove. \r\n\r\nOr do I misunderstand?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
