    "created_at": "2022-06-14T10:34:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-06-14T10:34:18Z",
    "body": "The prefixed version should not be removed from the compat-spec, but the \"text\" value does not need to have special handling anymore since that value is now part of the background-clip spec as well. Can probably make the prefixed property an alias.\r\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
